Kai Wang, 30-June-2018

This program is intended to add model perturbations to a given binary model in specfem3d.

Max number of input points is set at NMAXPTS = 100000.

sem_model_addpert    --- add a gaussian model perturbation
sem_model_checkboard --- add checkerboard model perturbations 

compile --- commands to compile the program 
--------------------------
Input: gaus01.dat/checkboard_grid.dat
----
 UTM_X                UTM_Y          UTM_Z
407648.316883206  3762400.26968899 -15000.0
----


Make changes to sbash_sem_model_addpert.bash/sbash_add_chb_anomalies.sh to submit the job via SLURM

